 ('Pilih urutan kata sifat yang benar:', 'a big red plastic ball', 'a plastic red big ball', 'a red big plastic ball', 'a big plastic red ball', 'Ukuran-warna-bahan.'),
 ('Pilih deskripsi yang memakai indra pendengaran:', 'The street was loud with cars and horns.', 'The street was long and went from the school to the market.', 'The street was gray and the buildings beside it were all new.', 'The street was new, and many shops were built along its side.', 'Loud.'),
