 ('Pilih kalimat yang SALAH:', 'She has hairs long black.', 'She has long black hair.', 'He has short brown hair.', 'They have blue eyes.', 'Kata sifat sebelum benda.'),
 ('Pilih pembuka deskripsi tempat yang menarik:', 'As soon as I opened the door, the smell of coffee wrapped around me.', 'This is a place where I like to go and sit down for an hour.', 'I will write about a place that I know very well in my town.', 'The place is a place that is in the city near my school.', 'Pembuka kuat.'),
 ('Apa yang sebaiknya dihindari dalam deskripsi?', 'kata umum seperti nice dan good', 'kata sifat yang spesifik dan sesuai konteks', 'detail dari lima indra dalam deskripsi', 'perbandingan sederhana seperti as cold as ice', 'Gunakan kata spesifik.'),
